\description{
Functions for the optional tables of \code{\link[=pax_from_mar]{pax_from_mar()}} (argument
\code{extra_tables}): data that only some stocks need, for tech report
figures, advice tables or model input, so that the assessment repositories
need no direct access to mar. Like the \link{pax_mar} functions, they return
tables decorated for \code{\link[=pax_import]{pax_import()}}.
}
